IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LORA-CASCADE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-STAGES          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 CONFIDENCE-SCORE    PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SAVINGS-PCT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CASCADE.
    IF NUM-STAGES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 94 TO CONFIDENCE-SCORE.
    MOVE 48 TO SAVINGS-PCT.
    MOVE 8600 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-STAGES.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
